      "leadSummary": "Early-diverging lineages and small-bodied animals reveal independent solutions to feeding, movement, tissue organization and life-cycle challenges.\n**Unit pathway.** This unit examines sponge water flow, support and ecology, then cnidarian nematocysts, nerve nets and colonies, flatworms, regeneration and parasitic stra",
